    <div style="--i:0"><div class="t"><strong>teacher</strong><span>your agent</span></div><p>Each topic gets a persona: the kind of person who would teach that subject in real life. A researcher checks facts before they reach you.</p><div class="rule">teacher-&lt;slug&gt; · researcher</div></div>
    <div style="--i:1"><div class="t"><strong>method</strong><span>ten skills</span></div><p>Measure your level, teach, summarize, build exams and exercises, grade, make cards, plan the session. Same steps every time.</p><div class="rule">agent/skills/slp-*/SKILL.md</div></div>
    <div style="--i:2"><div class="t"><strong>app</strong><span>uv run slp</span></div><p>Runs on localhost. Notes with Mermaid, LaTeX and images, typed or dictated. Exams, exercises, cards. It records every study session on its own.</p><div class="rule">1 notes · 2 exams · 3 cards</div></div>
